      "section": "4.6 Transfer to a second target",
      "words": 93,
      "text": "[TODO \u2014 conditional on the gpt-oss replay.] Frame as does near-term prediction transfer to a second model. gpt-oss windows are short \u2014 148 of 169 eventual-positive steps are also near-term-positive (versus 250 of 998 near-term for Qwen) \u2014 so it barely tests eventual against near-term; note the short window and do not present a gpt-oss eventual result as a separate finding. Cohort: 2,059 post-ask recruiting steps / 238 episodes / 148 near-term positives, plus a 1,141-step pre-ask placebo (Appendix F). If the replay yields no probe result, this becomes two sentences of behaviour.",
